# Retirement: Contribution limits checker (simplified)

Load examples/retirement/data/contribution_profile.txt as Contribution Profile

Find participant age and save as participant_age
Find coverage type and save as coverage_type

participant_age equals 0 if participant_age == nil

standard_401k_limit equals 23500
catch_up_50_plus equals 7500
catch_up_60_63 equals 11250

max_401k_deferral equals standard_401k_limit
max_401k_deferral equals standard_401k_limit plus catch_up_50_plus if participant_age >= 50
max_401k_deferral equals standard_401k_limit plus catch_up_60_63 if participant_age >= 60 and participant_age <= 63

ira_standard_limit equals 7000
ira_catch_up equals 1000
max_ira_contribution equals ira_standard_limit
max_ira_contribution equals ira_standard_limit plus ira_catch_up if participant_age >= 50

hsa_self_only_limit equals 4300
hsa_family_limit equals 8550
hsa_catch_up_55_plus equals 1000
max_hsa_contribution equals 0
max_hsa_contribution equals hsa_self_only_limit if coverage_type == self_only
max_hsa_contribution equals hsa_family_limit if coverage_type == family
max_hsa_contribution equals max_hsa_contribution plus hsa_catch_up_55_plus if participant_age >= 55

Route max_401k_deferral to retirement_planning_queue
